{"3988250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fantasy Billionaire", "steam_appid": 3988250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to go from zero to billionaire? In <i>Fantasy Billionaire</i>, you don’t just build businesses—you manage your life, make decisions that shape your future, and compete (or cooperate) with others to become the ultimate business legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/383c75814953b32fb30c7c64f884f5e5.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/383c75814953b32fb30c7c64f884f5e5.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with modest resources and turn a living city into your playground. Invest in restaurants, renovate buildings, acquire homes, and create skyscrapers that define the skyline. You can even try to buy any property or business, even if it’s not officially for sale. Research upgrades and add new features to your ventures—every purchase, upgrade, and decision affects the market and your path to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/eaa18b07c3a88206530f6a9e3a87c480.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/eaa18b07c3a88206530f6a9e3a87c480.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0b519528e28134619767145f17342416.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/0b519528e28134619767145f17342416.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just an entrepreneur—you’re a person with goals, lifestyle choices, and limited time. The better you manage your diet, exercise, housing, and style, the healthier and longer your life will be… and the higher your chances of professional success. Neglect your health, and it could cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0bb2d2d9e2be37b75e9fef3005e7ae45.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0bb2d2d9e2be37b75e9fef3005e7ae45.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0bb2d2d9e2be37b75e9fef3005e7ae45.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/36b276b6463df3de6b0815e9e45c9b87.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/36b276b6463df3de6b0815e9e45c9b87.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events—crises, unique career opportunities, rising costs, health issues—will test your adaptability. Adjust salaries, set prices, optimize staff, invest in yourself, and seize every window of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/ec064c0f98f037ecab3903ca28095c9b.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/ec064c0f98f037ecab3903ca28095c9b.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/f18aacb3d7a18bb5d326cbb8143b2ae9.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/f18aacb3d7a18bb5d326cbb8143b2ae9.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=99 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode:</strong> Customize your starting point and explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> A balanced challenge for players who want to grow from the ground up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode:</strong> Predefined profiles with intermediate options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Hard Mode:</strong> Start late, with little money and real risks—poor health can even kill you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/bed9df10d32cbcbccbff2855fa8b59e3.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/bed9df10d32cbcbccbff2855fa8b59e3.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/33188b50701fb0c80b5c2ceaf3a24de3.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/33188b50701fb0c80b5c2ceaf3a24de3.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=101 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against other magnates in two modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP:</strong> Be the first to reach $1 million in assets or accumulate the most wealth over 5, 10, 15, or 20 years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> Team up to build faster, conquer the city, and leave your mark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/b9cc0eef1e8bf791b99cc114942bb993.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/b9cc0eef1e8bf791b99cc114942bb993.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/b9cc0eef1e8bf791b99cc114942bb993.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/856d3f6fd86bc0ef8015168a8b66b016.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/856d3f6fd86bc0ef8015168a8b66b016.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your fortune to unimaginable heights. If your ambition knows no bounds, you can even buy the local soccer team and make history in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/2d39bfe5a286560ae2f6bdcacd0479d3.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/2d39bfe5a286560ae2f6bdcacd0479d3.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/2d39bfe5a286560ae2f6bdcacd0479d3.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/541acb1cf99803aeff214d818fea430a.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase empty lots and decide what to construct—from a single-family home to an apartment complex or the city’s tallest skyscraper. Every choice impacts your strategy and the local economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/6130d8a4c8d0aae7b2e5d04588977e7c.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/6130d8a4c8d0aae7b2e5d04588977e7c.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/6130d8a4c8d0aae7b2e5d04588977e7c.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/ec507107be6230abd07d4bd9aa751e4a.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/ec507107be6230abd07d4bd9aa751e4a.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inflation never stops. Markets fluctuate, affecting the prices and costs of all goods and services. Plan your investments carefully to grow your empire even as money changes value—or try your luck at the casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0097c6c4645d514bbcd2c046ef997057.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0097c6c4645d514bbcd2c046ef997057.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0097c6c4645d514bbcd2c046ef997057.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to go from zero to billionaire? In <i>Fantasy Billionaire</i>, you don’t just build businesses—you manage your life, make decisions that shape your future, and compete (or cooperate) with others to become the ultimate business legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/383c75814953b32fb30c7c64f884f5e5.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/383c75814953b32fb30c7c64f884f5e5.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with modest resources and turn a living city into your playground. Invest in restaurants, renovate buildings, acquire homes, and create skyscrapers that define the skyline. You can even try to buy any property or business, even if it’s not officially for sale. Research upgrades and add new features to your ventures—every purchase, upgrade, and decision affects the market and your path to the top.</p><p class=