ssets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/bed9df10d32cbcbccbff2855fa8b59e3.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/bed9df10d32cbcbccbff2855fa8b59e3.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/33188b50701fb0c80b5c2ceaf3a24de3.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/33188b50701fb0c80b5c2ceaf3a24de3.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=101 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against other magnates in two modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP:</strong> Be the first to reach $1 million in assets or accumulate the most wealth over 5, 10, 15, or 20 years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> Team up to build faster, conquer the city, and leave your mark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/b9cc0eef1e8bf791b99cc114942bb993.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/b9cc0eef1e8bf791b99cc114942bb993.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/b9cc0eef1e8bf791b99cc114942bb993.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/856d3f6fd86bc0ef8015168a8b66b016.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/856d3f6fd86bc0ef8015168a8b66b016.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your fortune to unimaginable heights. If your ambition knows no bounds, you can even buy the local soccer team and make history in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/2d39bfe5a286560ae2f6bdcacd0479d3.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/2d39bfe5a286560ae2f6bdcacd0479d3.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/2d39bfe5a286560ae2f6bdcacd0479d3.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/541acb1cf99803aeff214d818fea430a.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase empty lots and decide what to construct—from a single-family home to an apartment complex or the city’s tallest skyscraper. Every choice impacts your strategy and the local economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/6130d8a4c8d0aae7b2e5d04588977e7c.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/6130d8a4c8d0aae7b2e5d04588977e7c.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/6130d8a4c8d0aae7b2e5d04588977e7c.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/ec507107be6230abd07d4bd9aa751e4a.avif?t=1784039198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras_big/ec507107be6230abd07d4bd9aa751e4a.webp?t=1784039198 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inflation never stops. Markets fluctuate, affecting the prices and costs of all goods and services. Plan your investments carefully to grow your empire even as money changes value—or try your luck at the casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0097c6c4645d514bbcd2c046ef997057.poster.avif?t=1784039198\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0097c6c4645d514bbcd2c046ef997057.webm?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/extras/0097c6c4645d514bbcd2c046ef997057.mp4?t=1784039198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build your empire from scratch in a living city. Manage businesses, your personal life, and compete or cooperate online in a deep economic simulator with multiple game modes for every play style.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988250/82692ca2c5429e3a400c36a1e17b222da